name\": \"What makes the AmbientScreen Curved 1.8 ideal for home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Its curved design with 2000R, 3000R, or 4000R curvature matches the eye's natural shape, enhancing immersion and reducing eye strain during long viewing sessions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the key technical specifications of this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, 4K UHD resolution, 800 nits brightness, 178\\u00b0 viewing angle, and a high refresh rate of 3840Hz for smooth motion rendering.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the display size be customized for different room sizes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, AmbientScreen Curved 1.8 is available in three sizes: 120\\\", 150\\\", and 180\\\", allowing you to choose a size that best fits your room and viewing preferences.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to flat LED or OLED screens?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike flat screens, its curved design offers a wider field of view with more uniform picture quality and reduced peripheral distortion, providing a more engaging cinema experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this curved LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation requires a professional setup that accommodates curved configurations and mounting supports, ensuring structural stability and optimal viewing angles in your home cinema.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a warranty or after-sales support included?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty and dedicated after-sales support to ensure long-term performance and customer satisfaction.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the AmbientScreen Curved 1.8 and can it handle ambient lighting?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With 800 nits brightness, it performs well in moderate ambient lighting, maintaining vibrant images and good visibility even in open-plan living spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of rooms or environments are best suited for this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is perfect for media rooms, game rooms, open-plan living areas, and entertainment lounges, where immersive, wraparound visual experiences elevate entertainment quality.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"AmbientScreen Curved 1.8\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/ambientscreen-curved-18\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url